# Line endings: LF everywhere, in the repository and in every working copy.
#
# This repo is edited on Windows but served from a Samba share to two Linux
# WordPress hosts and shipped to wp.org, so a per-machine core.autocrlf setting
# was giving three different answers. Pinning eol=lf here overrides autocrlf for
# this repo: every checkout, on every platform, gets identical bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled translation catalogs — never touch these
*.mo binary
